{!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for enrolling in the EverQuote PRO platform.  You should start seeing matches in your inbox immediately; any delay of more than 24 hours should be looked at in our system so please let us know.

Your Customer Success contact is X, which can be reached at xxx-xxx-xxxx or name@everquote.com.

Just to make sure we are on the same page let me reiterate a few things that we covered on our call:

1. Your card will be automatically recharged for the amount of your initial deposit when your balance hits $25.  You will also get a low balance warning at $50.  If you want to reduce further automatic charges you need to change that in the payment screen in PRO.

2. If you have opted into a match deposit upon enrollment, please be aware that your initial down payment is fully non-refundable.  Those funds will remain locked on the account, and can only be used for lead purchases.  

3. You have the ability to return leads through PRO, and do not need to call in order to do so.  If a return is rejected it is most likely our system rejecting it automatically.  You still have the right to contact X, who can be reached at xxx-xxx-xxxx or name@everquote.com, for assistance.

4. If you need to pause your account for Vacation or other travel you can do so here in the PRO platform.  If you need to pause longer than 2 weeks please contact X, who can be reached at xxx-xxx-xxxx or name@everquote.com.

Of course I am always here if you need help, or have a quick question.

Regards,
{!User.FirstName}